re 500.\n\n**Now restart the cloud:**\n\n```\ncd cloud\nbun run dev   # or bun run dev:rebuild if Docker is involved\n```\n\nIn the cloud log, watch for:\n- `[token.service] APP_AUTH_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY loaded and ready for RS256 signing` \u2014 key parsed correctly.\n- Or `[token.service] APP_AUTH_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY is set but failed to import: <reason>` \u2014 paste/format issue with the PEM in `.env`; the `<reason>` will tell you what's wrong (most often missing newlines).\n\nOnce the cloud says \"loaded and ready\", the mobile-app `console.warn` about \"Failed to generate signed user token\" should disappear and the webview URL will carry both `aos_temp_token` and `aos_signed_user_token`."
